3. ISLES'26 official evaluation utilities — NOT REDISTRIBUTED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Authored by Ezequiel de la Rosa (ISLES'26 challenge organiser).

`analysis/official/eval_utils.py` is deliberately ABSENT from this repository.
It is not our work and it ships without a licence header, so it is not ours to
re-publish. Most scorers in `analysis/` import it — directly or through
`analysis/official_score.py` — so you must obtain it yourself from the official
ISLES'26 challenge materials and place it at `analysis/official/eval_utils.py`.
It is listed in `.gitignore` so that it cannot be committed here by accident.

See `analysis/official/README.md` for what the file must provide, which scripts
need it and which do not, and why the scorers use the organisers' code rather
than a reimplementation.

